 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSvea Logistik AB                                              MASTER SERVICES\nIndustrivägen 3, 411 05 Göteborg, Sweden                           AGREEMENT\nMomsreg.nr: SE973917082101\nReg No: SE-850612\n\nFROM                                                            FAKTURERAS TILL\nSvea Logistik AB                                                Mälardalen Kemi AB\nIndustrivägen 3                                                 Industrivägen 3\n411 05 Göteborg                                                 411 05 Göteborg\nSweden                                                          Sweden\nVAT: SE973917082101\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026-04-13 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Svea Logistik\nAB, with its registered office at Industrivägen 3, Göteborg (\"Party A\"), and Mälardalen Kemi AB, with its registered office at Industrivägen\n3, Göteborg (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Svea Logistik AB / Erik Lindqvist\nParty B      Mälardalen Kemi AB / Anna Söderberg\nDate         2026-04-13",
